      "title_zh": "学生的工作",
      "title_en": "A student's job",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "是", "学生", "。", "晚上", "，", "我", "还", "要", "去", "工作", "。"],
        ["工作", "的", "地方", "很", "远", "，", "我", "要", "坐", "一", "个", "小时", "的", "车", "。", "车", "里", "人", "很", "多", "。"],
        ["我", "一", "个", "小时", "能", "得到", "二十", "块", "钱", "。", "这", "个", "月", "，", "我", "得到", "了", "一千", "块", "。", "我", "觉得", "这些", "钱", "很", "多", "。"],
        ["我", "给", "妈妈", "买", "了", "一些", "东西", "。", "妈妈", "说", "：", "“", "你", "真", "好", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "也", "明白", "了", "：", "工作", "很", "难", "，", "钱", "很", "重要", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I'm a student. In the evenings I also have to go to work.",
        "My workplace is far away — I have to spend an hour on the bus. The bus is very crowded.",
        "I can earn twenty kuai an hour. This month I earned a thousand kuai. That feels like a lot of money to me.",
        "I bought Mum a few things. Mum said: “You’re so good to me!”",
        "I’ve also realised: work is hard, and money matters."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["学生", "远", "明白"],
