      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "儿子进球了",
      "title_en": "My son scored",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "的", "儿子", "五", "岁", "了", "。", "他", "非常", "喜欢", "球", "。", "他", "有", "五", "个", "球", "。"],
        ["今天", "，", "我们", "一起", "去", "玩", "球", "。", "他", "跑", "来", "跑", "去", "，", "一", "点", "也", "不", "想", "回家", "。"],
        ["最后", "，", "他", "进", "了", "一", "个", "球", "！", "他", "说", "：", "“", "你", "看", "！", "你", "看", "！", "”"],
        ["晚上", "回家", "，", "他", "告诉", "了", "妈妈", "。", "妈妈", "也", "笑", "了", "。", "她", "说", "：", "“", "你", "真", "行", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "想", "，", "我", "会", "记得", "这", "一", "天", "的", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "My son is five. He loves playing with a ball. He has five balls.",
        "Today we went to play football together. He ran all over the place and didn’t want to go home at all.",
        "In the end he scored a goal! He said: “Look! Look!”",
        "When we got home in the evening, he told his mum. She smiled too and said: “Well done!”",
        "I think I’ll remember this day."
